sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminClient as GatewayAdminClient
    participant Gateway as Kryptonian Gateway
    participant DeviceA as Device A - DICOM SCU
    participant DeviceB as Device B - DICOM SCP
    participant TrustA as Device A Trust Validator
    participant TrustB as Device B Trust Validator
    participant DICOM as DICOM TLS Session

    AdminClient->>Gateway: POST /api/devices for sender
    Gateway-->>AdminClient: Sender pending device
    AdminClient->>Gateway: POST /api/devices/{id}/activation-code
    Gateway-->>AdminClient: Sender activation code
    AdminClient->>Gateway: POST /api/devices for receiver
    Gateway-->>AdminClient: Receiver pending device
    AdminClient->>Gateway: POST /api/devices/{id}/activation-code
    Gateway-->>AdminClient: Receiver activation code

    DeviceA->>Gateway: EST simpleenroll with sender activation code
    Gateway-->>DeviceA: Sender certificate and CA chain
    DeviceB->>Gateway: EST simpleenroll with receiver activation code
    Gateway-->>DeviceB: Receiver certificate and CA chain

    DeviceA->>TrustA: Validate receiver certificate against gateway CA chain
    TrustA-->>DeviceA: Trusted or rejected
    DeviceB->>TrustB: Validate sender certificate against gateway CA chain
    TrustB-->>DeviceB: Trusted or rejected

    alt Both certificates trusted
        DeviceB->>DICOM: Start TLS Store SCP
        DeviceA->>DICOM: Connect with sender client certificate
        DICOM->>DeviceB: Present sender certificate
        DICOM->>DeviceA: Present receiver certificate
        DeviceA->>DICOM: Send C-STORE request
        DICOM->>DeviceB: Deliver DICOM object
        DeviceB-->>DeviceA: C-STORE success
    else Either certificate fails trust validation
        DeviceA-->>DeviceA: Abort transfer
        DeviceB-->>DeviceB: Reject association
    end

    opt Demo cleanup
        AdminClient->>Gateway: POST /api/devices/{id}/remove
        Gateway-->>AdminClient: Device status removed
        AdminClient->>Gateway: DELETE /api/devices/{id}
        Gateway-->>AdminClient: 204 No Content if archived
    end
